+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Commands
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
+
+* `init`: creates a new analysis configuration file based on standard and optional custom conventions
+* `generateReports`: generates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report, aggregating results of multiple analyses (the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands)
+* `updateLandscape`: the same as `analyzeLandscape` (kept for existing scripts)
+* `updateConfig`: updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+* `createConventionsFile`, `exportStandardConventions`: create or export analysis conventions files
+* `extractGitHistory`, `extractGitSubHistory`, `extractFiles`: utilities for git history and file extraction
\ No newline at end of file
